{"seq":1,"slug":"autoregressive-bottleneck","title":"自回归解码瓶颈","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/speculative-decoding/foundations/autoregressive-bottleneck","wordCount":1397,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"自回归解码瓶颈\">自回归解码瓶颈</h1><p>一块 H100 的峰值算力约 989 TFLOPS（BF16），而它的显存带宽约 3.35 TB/s。这两个数字的比值决定了一件事：当一个算子搬运的字节远多于它要做的浮点运算时，GPU 大部分时间在等显存，算力空转。LLM 的逐 token 解码恰恰落在这个「等显存」的区间——理解这一点，是理解推测解码为什么存在的唯一入口。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-算术强度与两类瓶颈\">核心概念：算术强度与两类瓶颈</h2><p>判断一个算子是「算力受限」还是「访存受限」，看它的<strong>算术强度</strong>（arithmetic intensity）：每从显存读取一个字节，平均能换来多少次浮点运算。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>算术强度</mtext><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mtext>FLOPs</mtext><mtext>Bytes moved</mtext></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{算术强度} = \\frac{\\text{FLOPs}}{\\text{Bytes moved}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">算术强度</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.2408em;vertical-align:-0.8804em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Bytes moved</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">FLOPs</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8804em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>把它和硬件的「计算带宽 / 显存带宽」比值（H100 上约 295 FLOP/Byte）相比：算术强度高于这个临界点，算子被计算卡住；低于它，算子被显存卡住。</p>\n<p>LLM 推理天然分裂成两个相位，落在临界点两侧：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[请求到达] --&gt; B[Prefill 预填充&lt;br/&gt;一次性处理整段 prompt]&#10;  B --&gt; C{算术强度高&lt;br/&gt;矩阵 x 矩阵}&#10;  C --&gt; D[计算受限&lt;br/&gt;GPU 算力跑满]&#10;  B --&gt; E[Decode 逐 token 解码]&#10;  E --&gt; F{算术强度低&lt;br/&gt;矩阵 x 向量}&#10;  F --&gt; G[访存受限&lt;br/&gt;GPU 等权重搬运]&#10;  G --&gt; H[每个 token 都要重搬一遍全部权重]\">flowchart TD\n  A[请求到达] --&gt; B[Prefill 预填充&lt;br/&gt;一次性处理整段 prompt]\n  B --&gt; C{算术强度高&lt;br/&gt;矩阵 x 矩阵}\n  C --&gt; D[计算受限&lt;br/&gt;GPU 算力跑满]\n  B --&gt; E[Decode 逐 token 解码]\n  E --&gt; F{算术强度低&lt;br/&gt;矩阵 x 向量}\n  F --&gt; G[访存受限&lt;br/&gt;GPU 等权重搬运]\n  G --&gt; H[每个 token 都要重搬一遍全部权重]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>相位</th>\n<th>计算形态</th>\n<th>算术强度</th>\n<th>瓶颈</th>\n<th>推测解码能否帮上忙</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Prefill</td>\n<td>矩阵 × 矩阵（整段并行）</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>计算受限</td>\n<td>几乎无关</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Decode（batch=1）</td>\n<td>矩阵 × 向量（逐 token）</td>\n<td>极低</td>\n<td>访存受限</td>\n<td>直接受益</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>推测解码的全部杠杆，都压在 decode 这一相位上。Prefill 已经把算力用满了，没有空闲可挤；decode 才是那个「算力闲置、显存忙死」的地方。</p>\n<h2 id=\"为什么逐-token-解码是矩阵-向量乘\">为什么逐 token 解码是矩阵-向量乘</h2><p>自回归生成的定义就是串行：第 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6151em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span></span></span></span></span> 个 token 的概率依赖前 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t-1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6984em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span> 个 token。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mo>…</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>n</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><munderover><mo>∏</mo><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>n</mi></munderover><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>∣</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mo>…</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P(x_1, x_2, \\dots, x_n) = \\prod_{t=1}^{n} P(x_t \\mid x_1, \\dots, x_{t-1})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\">…</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.9185em;vertical-align:-1.2671em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.6514em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8829em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">=</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∏</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.3em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.2671em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∣</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\">…</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2083em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>在已有 KV cache 的情况下，生成下一个 token 时，新进入网络的只有<strong>一个</strong> token 的隐藏向量。于是每一层的核心运算从训练/prefill 时的「矩阵 × 矩阵」退化成「矩阵 × 向量」：权重矩阵是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>W</mi><mo>∈</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"double-struck\">R</mi><mrow><mi>d</mi><mo>×</mo><mi>d</mi></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">W \\in \\mathbb{R}^{d \\times d}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7224em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8491em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathbb\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8491em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">×</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，输入是单个向量 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>∈</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"double-struck\">R</mi><mi>d</mi></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x \\in \\mathbb{R}^{d}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5782em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8491em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathbb\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8491em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>。</p>\n<p>这笔运算的代价极不对称：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>要读的字节</strong>：整个权重矩阵 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>W</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">W</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span></span></span></span></span>，约 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>d</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d^2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 个参数 × 每参数字节数。对 70B 模型，单次前向要把约 140 GB（FP16）权重从显存读一遍。</li>\n<li><strong>要做的运算</strong>：约 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>d</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2 d^2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 次乘加，相对权重读取量，算术强度只有 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(1)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 量级。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>结果是：生成一个 token 的时间，几乎完全由「把全部权重搬一遍」决定，而不是由算法做了多少计算决定。这也解释了一个常见现象——同一个模型，batch=1 时每 token 延迟和 batch=8 时几乎一样，因为权重只搬了一遍却服务了 8 个请求，算力的空闲被 batch 填上了。这正是 <a href=\"../practice/serving-batching-spec\">批服务下的推测</a> 一篇里推测解码收益会随 batch 变化的根源。</p>\n<h2 id=\"闲置算力-推测解码的可乘之机\">闲置算力：推测解码的可乘之机</h2><p>既然 decode 是访存受限的，就引出一个关键推论：<strong>用目标模型并行验证 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span> 个 token，和验证 1 个 token，耗时几乎相同。</strong></p>\n<p>原因是这两种情况搬运的权重量一样（都是把全部权重读一遍），区别只在于参与计算的输入是「1 个向量」还是「<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span> 个向量堆成的小矩阵」。当 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span> 不大（比如 4 到 8）时，多出来的计算落在那块闲置算力里，几乎不增加墙钟时间。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[&quot;朴素解码: 生成 5 个 token&quot;] --&gt; B[&quot;5 次串行前向&lt;br/&gt;每次搬一遍权重&lt;br/&gt;= 5 个搬运周期&quot;]&#10;  C[&quot;推测解码: 草稿先猜 4 个&quot;] --&gt; D[&quot;目标模型 1 次并行前向&lt;br/&gt;验证 5 个位置&lt;br/&gt;= 1 个搬运周期&quot;]&#10;  D --&gt; E[&quot;若全部接受&lt;br/&gt;= 5 个 token / 1 个周期&quot;]\">graph TD\n  A[\"朴素解码: 生成 5 个 token\"] --&gt; B[\"5 次串行前向&lt;br/&gt;每次搬一遍权重&lt;br/&gt;= 5 个搬运周期\"]\n  C[\"推测解码: 草稿先猜 4 个\"] --&gt; D[\"目标模型 1 次并行前向&lt;br/&gt;验证 5 个位置&lt;br/&gt;= 1 个搬运周期\"]\n  D --&gt; E[\"若全部接受&lt;br/&gt;= 5 个 token / 1 个周期\"]</pre><p>这就是推测解码的物理基础：它不是在「算得更快」，而是在「把被访存浪费掉的计算捡回来用」。草稿机制负责猜，验证负责把猜对的部分一次性兑现，从而把 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span> 次搬运周期压成 1 次。具体怎么猜、怎么验，是 <a href=\"draft-verify-paradigm\">草稿-验证范式</a> 的主题。</p>\n<h2 id=\"衡量瓶颈的实际指标\">衡量瓶颈的实际指标</h2><p>工程上用两个延迟指标把上面的理论对应到可观测量，它们在 <a href=\"../../llm-serving-inference-systems/foundations/serving-metrics\">LLM 服务推理系统</a> 一篇有系统讨论，这里只点出与推测解码直接相关的一个：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>指标</th>\n<th>含义</th>\n<th>受瓶颈影响</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>TTFT（首 token 延迟）</td>\n<td>prompt 进来到第一个 token 吐出</td>\n<td>由 prefill 主导（计算受限）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>TPOT / ITL（token 间延迟）</td>\n<td>相邻两个输出 token 的间隔</td>\n<td>由 decode 主导（访存受限）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>推测解码几乎只改善 TPOT——它压缩的是 token 之间那段「搬权重」的等待。对一个交互式聊天场景，用户感知的「打字速度」就是 TPOT 的倒数，这也是推测解码最直接的用户体验收益所在。而对 TTFT，它基本无能为力，因为 prefill 不在它的射程内。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>现代 GPU 的算力远超显存带宽所能喂饱的程度；一个算子是否受益于算力，取决于它的算术强度是否高于硬件临界点。</li>\n<li>LLM 推理分两相：prefill 是矩阵-矩阵乘、计算受限；decode 是矩阵-向量乘、访存受限。推测解码只对 decode 相位有效。</li>\n<li>逐 token 解码慢，不是因为算得多，而是因为每个 token 都要把全部权重重搬一遍，而真正的计算少到让算力空转。</li>\n<li>由于访存受限，<strong>并行验证 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span> 个 token 与验证 1 个几乎等价</strong>——这块闲置算力就是推测解码的全部杠杆。</li>\n<li>它改善的是 TPOT（token 间延迟），不改善 TTFT；适合提升交互式生成的「吐字速度」。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>延伸阅读：下一篇 <a href=\"draft-verify-paradigm\">草稿-验证范式</a> 给出利用这块闲置算力的具体循环；<a href=\"lossless-guarantee\">分布无损性保证</a> 解释为什么这样做不损失质量。跨库可参考 <a href=\"../../llm-serving-inference-systems/foundations/decoding-bottlenecks\">LLM 服务推理系统 · 解码瓶颈</a> 对同一瓶颈在系统层面的展开。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"自回归解码瓶颈","id":"自回归解码瓶颈"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：算术强度与两类瓶颈","id":"核心概念-算术强度与两类瓶颈"},{"level":2,"text":"为什么逐 token 解码是矩阵-向量乘","id":"为什么逐-token-解码是矩阵-向量乘"},{"level":2,"text":"闲置算力：推测解码的可乘之机","id":"闲置算力-推测解码的可乘之机"},{"level":2,"text":"衡量瓶颈的实际指标","id":"衡量瓶颈的实际指标"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":null,"next":{"title":"草稿-验证范式","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/speculative-decoding/foundations/draft-verify-paradigm"}}